@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@ragAdminToken = {{$processEnv RAG_ADMIN_TOKEN}}
@jobId = replace-with-job-id
@documentId = replace-with-document-id

### Upload knowledge document
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/knowledge/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{ragAdminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=ragUploadBoundary

--ragUploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="projects-and-architecture.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ../docs/rag-corpus/projects-and-architecture.md
--ragUploadBoundary--

### Get ingestion job status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/knowledge/jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ragAdminToken}}

### Get document status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/knowledge/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ragAdminToken}}

### Cancel a queued ingestion job
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/knowledge/jobs/{{jobId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{ragAdminToken}}

### Stage a new index
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/knowledge/indexes/stage
Authorization: Bearer {{ragAdminToken}}

### Activate the staged index
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/knowledge/indexes/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{ragAdminToken}}

### Roll back the active index
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/knowledge/indexes/rollback
Authorization: Bearer {{ragAdminToken}}
